data: {"id": "5c78da23f4d044d3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1291", "run_id": "5c78da23f4d044d3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与冲突\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态（Kubernetes + Prometheus）：** `Pending`，Container `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating`，`restarts=0`，无 previous termination。Pod UID=`86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`，调度到 `node2`。\n\n2. **根因事件（kubectl_events + kubectl_describe）：** 两个重复性 Warning 事件（每 44 分钟内各出现 23 次和 18 次）：\n   - `FailedMount`: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - `FailedMount`: `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788771196772, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

