data: {"id": "5c78da23f4d044d3-final", "run_id": "5c78da23f4d044d3", "seq": 1296, "ts_ms": 1788771210148, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod YAML中定义的Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'（Optional: false），导致kubelet挂载卷永久失败，Pod被卡在Pending/ContainerCreating状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod phase: Pending; container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating | 确认应用容器 `app` 处于启动前阻塞阶段，尚未运行 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-63293e885cdf) | 直接定位挂载失败的具体资源缺失原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` for unmounted volumes=[input] (fact-23d3e5b75b0d) | 证实 kubelet 在长达 44 分钟内反复重试挂载失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-e9f8d3ed29d7) | 独立观测验证容器处于 Waiting 状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0` (fact-9fdbbe21a68a) | 证实容器从未启动过，不存在 CrashLoopBackOff 等运行时问题 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#2）明确指缺少的配置对象为 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"`，且 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态（#1），这与 Metrics 中观测到的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态（#4）及 `restart_count=0`（#5）完全一致，证明故障发生在调度后的挂载阶段，而非容器启动后。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → kubelet 挂载卷永久失败 → 容器无法启动 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **Pod YAML 定义引用了缺失的依赖资源**，具体由 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"` 不存在引起。由于挂载操作在容器启动前发生且失败，Pod 被永久阻塞在 `Pending` 状态，导致应用无法运行且无重启记录。证据支持充分。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 39.2s (Evidence 33.7s, RCA 5.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.323, "metrics": {"run_id": "5c78da23f4d044d3", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.33068704605103, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65330.687046051025, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 62036.26561164856, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8438.493967056274, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3017.841339111328}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18296.384811401367, "success": tru